@startuml 08-seq-desktop-startup
title desktop shell: launch, sidecar engine, health gate, tray and badge
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam dpi 150
autonumber
skinparam maxMessageSize 240

participant "Windows / macOS" as OS
participant "Tauri shell\nlib.rs:532 run()" as TAURI
participant "Sidecar Supervisor\nthread (lib.rs:666 loop)" as SUP
participant "node process\nonni serve" as NODE
participant "WebView\n(main window)" as WV

OS -> TAURI : Onni Work.exe
TAURI -> TAURI : ctrlc handler -> kill sidecar, exit(0)\nlib.rs:552
TAURI -> TAURI : single-instance plugin: second launch\nonly shows the existing window (lib.rs:563)
TAURI -> TAURI : build_main_window visible:false\nuntil geometry restored (lib.rs:219)
TAURI -> TAURI : build_tray: Open / Quit\nlib.rs:352-362
TAURI -> SUP : std::thread::spawn(supervisor)\nlib.rs:576

SUP -> SUP : require_node(): node on PATH, >= 20\nlib.rs:890 / else engine_missing page lib.rs:909
SUP -> SUP : resolve_entry(): ONNI_DESKTOP_ENTRY else\n$HOME/.onni/versions/current/node_modules/@onni/work/dist/index.js\nlib.rs:1605
SUP -> SUP : pick_port(): first free 4321..4330 (lib.rs:1502)
SUP -> NODE : spawn_sidecar: `node <entry> serve <port>`\nenv ONNI_DESKTOP=1, ONNI_SUPERVISED=1,\nONNI_SUPERVISOR_PID, ONNI_DISCLAIM_EXEC (lib.rs:922)
NODE --> SUP : stdout/stderr tail -> log VecDeque
loop every 300ms, up to HEALTH_TIMEOUT 60s (lib.rs:1487,40)
  SUP -> NODE : GET http://127.0.0.1:<port>/api/v1/health
end
alt healthy
  SUP -> WV : window.navigate("http://127.0.0.1:<port>") (lib.rs:718)
  note right of WV : navigation is allowed only to the shell's\nown origin (is_own_origin) +\ncapabilities remote.urls 127.0.0.1:*
  SUP -> SUP : monitor_badge thread (lib.rs:1390):\nrunning_run_count via GET /api/v1/runs (lib.rs:1378)
  SUP -> OS : set_badge_count (cap 99) / Windows\noverlay icon (lib.rs:1410-1413)
else timeout
  SUP -> NODE : child.kill(); fail() page with log tail
end

== lifetime ==
OS -> WV : user closes window
WV -> TAURI : WindowEvent::CloseRequested -> api.prevent_close()\nhide to tray (lib.rs:627/636)
WV -> SUP : window move/resize -> geometry writer\ncoalesced to $HOME/.onni/desktop-window.json (lib.rs:577,1520)
NODE -> SUP : child exits (try_wait Some(status))
SUP -> SUP : restart the loop (new port + entry)
TAURI -> SUP : RunEvent::Exit -> stop_sidecar (lib.rs:466/651)
note over TAURI : restart_app (lib.rs:873) re-runs the boot loop;\nno updater, no deep-links, no auto-start plugin

@enduml
